      "structure" : {
        "group" : 438,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 5655
      },
      "text" : "1913. At that time, cash and checks were the predominant means of payment. Since then, and"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        329.43610000000001,
        413.54499999999979,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 438,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 5655
      },
      "text" : "especially since the 1990s, the U.S. payment system has shifted away from the use of checks"
