    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90,
        279.62060000000002,
        424.72090000000003,
        17.944500000000005
      ],
      "text" : "In 2018, 162 billion noncash transactions valued at approximately $1,252 trillion passed through"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90.000900000000001,
        265.43610000000001,
        420.69399999999979,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "the U.S. payment system. Measured by annual aggregate value, wire transfers, automated clear-"
