    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90.000900000000001,
        249.43610000000001,
        416.84599999999978,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "inghouse (ACH) payments, and checks were the leading payment methods in the United States."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90.000900000000001,
        233.43610000000001,
        431.96999999999969,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "Measured by annual aggregate number, however, debit cards, credit cards, and ACH payments were"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        90.000900000000001,
        217.43610000000001,
        418.04599999999999,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text" : "the leading payment methods ( figure 6.2). Today’s prominence of electronic payments reflects a"
    },
